    "long_instructions": "##Social Media for the 13 Colonies\r\n\r\nYou will be working with AI to create a social media page that might have been used by the 13 colonies, if the internet had been invented back then! Use the AI Chat to get suggestions about what you could add into your design.\r\n\r\nChoose three suggestions that you like, write them down, and move onto the next level to create your site.",
